Package: finclean
Title: Financial Data Cleaning and Diagnostics Toolkit
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tasnim Ara", "Siddique", , "siddiqut@lawrence.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for cleaning and diagnosing messy financial datasets.
    Includes functions for parsing currency strings, standardizing fiscal year
    formats, normalizing account names, detecting outliers, auditing data quality,
    and visualizing anomalies in financial data.
